  "On ally's action, gain 1 <link\\=\"s|119\"><u>Ice Crystal</u></link> stack. Stacks up to 12 times. After using a skill, when Ice Crystal reaches 10 stacks, activate a <link\\=\"s|100\"><u>Resonance</u></link>, spending 10 Ice Crystal stacks to deal 65% follow-up Ice damage to the main target. This Resonance is guaranteed to be a critical hit.\\nWhen using Frost Lily or Winter Storm, if the Resonance is activated, gain Parhelion.\\nParhelion is used to strengthen Durandal of Ice.": "",
  "At the end of Kotone's turn, gain a shield equal to 15% of Attack for 1 turn.": "",
