  "r:\"^Activate Winter's Edge \\((\\d+) turn\\), and Ice dmg to (\\d+) foe \\(([\\d\\.]+)% Atk\\)\\. While Winter's Edge is active, when ally is attacked, grant Glacial Heart to all allies, protecting from up to (\\d+) dmg \\(max (\\d+) times, (\\d+) turns\\)\\. When allies deal Ice dmg with skill, Highlight, Theurgy, or Resonance, gain (\\d+) Winter's Vestige\\. When Winter's Edge ends, spend all Winter's Vestige, and deal Ice dmg to target selected that turn \\(\\(number of Winter's Vestige \\+ (\\d+)\\) x ([\\d\\.]+)% Atk\\)\\. This damage is counted as a Resonance\\.$\"": ""
